@startuml
title Expense Creation and Approval - simplified Architecture B (local, synchronous)

|Member (Swing view/presenter)|
start
:Enter group, payer, participants, amount, date,
description, split method, optional receipt file;
:Submit (presenter runs use case off the EDT);

|ExpenseService (application.service)|
:Resolve trusted current account
(no actor ID in the command);
:Validate input shape: plain decimal, exact at group scale
(reject e.g. USD 10.005), size limits, percentages;
if (Input valid?) then (no)
  :Return ValidationFailed (nothing stored);
  |Member (Swing view/presenter)|
  :Show clear message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|LocalReceiptStore (adapter.out.files)|
if (Receipt attached?) then (yes)
  :Validate JPEG/PNG by content, size <= 10 MiB;
  if (Valid?) then (no)
    |Member (Swing view/presenter)|
    :Show receipt error; nothing stored;
    stop
  else (yes)
    :Copy file to app-managed directory
    under an opaque ID (outside SQLite commit);
  endif
else (no)
endif

|SQLite UnitOfWork (one connection)|
:BEGIN IMMEDIATE;
:Check current membership of submitter, payer
and every participant in the group;
if (All checks pass?) then (no)
  :ROLLBACK;
  |LocalReceiptStore (adapter.out.files)
  :Delete copied receipt file (best effort;
  startup sweep removes orphans);
  |Member (Swing view/presenter)|
  :Show validation/authorization error;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Exact allocation in integer minor units
(equal: quotient/remainder; percent: T x w / D,
leftover by descending remainder, ties by order);
:Insert PENDING expense, ordered shares,
receipt record (same group);
:Insert one Notification for every
other current group member;
if (All writes succeed?) then (no)
  :ROLLBACK (notification failure
  rolls back the submission);
  |LocalReceiptStore (adapter.out.files)
  :Delete copied receipt file (best effort);
  |Member (Swing view/presenter)|
  :Show failure; no success indication;
  stop
else (yes)
  :COMMIT;
endif

|Member (Swing view/presenter)|
:Show "Submitted - awaiting review"
(success reported only after commit);

|Reviewer (Swing view/presenter)|
:Notification refresh (on demand or poll <= 60 s)
shows expense and submitter;
:Open expense details; choose Approve or Reject;

|ExpenseService (application.service)|
:Resolve trusted current account;

|SQLite UnitOfWork (one connection)|
:BEGIN IMMEDIATE (busy: bounded wait, then restart the whole
transaction and rerun authorization; on exhaustion fail
with no success indication);
:Verify current membership and reviewer flag;
if (Authorized reviewer?) then (no)
  :ROLLBACK; no state or balance change;
  |Reviewer (Swing view/presenter)|
  :Show denial;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Conditional update:
PENDING -> APPROVED or REJECTED;
if (Exactly one row changed?) then (no)
  :ROLLBACK; return Conflict
  (already decided; no second effect);
  |Reviewer (Swing view/presenter)|
  :Show "Already decided";
  stop
else (yes)
  :Insert ApprovalDecision;
  :COMMIT;
endif

|Reviewer (Swing view/presenter)|
if (Decision?) then (approve)
  :Approved shares now feed derived balances;
else (reject)
  :Rejected expense has no financial effect;
endif
stop
@enduml
